hybrid hybrid frontend-familie-tilbake      hybrid  8 3 120 35 qwen3.6-35b-a3b-optiq-64g
hybrid hybrid frontend-familie-tilbake      hybrid  8 3 120 45 qwen3.6-35b-a3b-8bit-64g
hybrid hybrid frontend-familie-tilbake      hybrid  8 3 120 35 occamy-1.0-4bit-64g
hybrid hybrid spring-ia-tjenester-metrikker control 8 6 120 35 qwen3.6-35b-a3b-optiq-64g
hybrid hybrid spring-ia-tjenester-metrikker hybrid  8 6 120 35 qwen3.6-35b-a3b-optiq-64g
hybrid hybrid spring-ia-tjenester-metrikker hybrid  8 6 120 45 qwen3.6-35b-a3b-8bit-64g
